<title>UK: Credit Local sets 300 bln lire bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 300 bln lire bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credito Italiano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN ITL   COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    05.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.845   PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (M) 5-50   SALE LIMITS USL/UK/IT/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
</text>
